  "purpose": "Find the plane in which the Coxeter element of A4, B4, F4 or H4 turns by 2 pi/h and project a regular or Wythoff 4-polytope onto it, giving the h-fold symmetric drawing with its concentric rings, written as SVG or as a flat glTF.",
  "form": "library_module",
  "asset_role": null,
